   "title": "Docs refresh (hourly)",
   "date": "2026-11-23",
   "html": "<p><strong>Docs refresh (hourly): README, sketch and campaign notes brought up to v0.5.20; five README result statements checked against their ledger status.</strong></p><ul><li><strong>README:</strong></li><li>The status paragraph now carries the A3 and A4 finals and the speculative-decoding result. \"Ties dense\" is gone everywhere: the full-precision A2f is \"0.9% below dense in point estimate, no equivalence test\", and A3mx is \"not shown to tie dense\" (v0.5.19 erratum).</li><li>A new results bullet covers A3/A4 (C208, C210 PARTIAL; SQ394).</li><li>The Byte Quest table no longer says the 200M E13 runs are unanalysed (SQ374, v0.5.15).</li><li><strong>Status-wording check</strong> (quick review 14:24), five README statements vs <code>experiments/claims-status.md</code>. Four were fixed and one already matched:</li><li>\"Loops don't pay yet\" now says C6 PARTIAL.</li><li>The A2 headline now says C209 VERIFIED at recipe level (it said \"exploratory\").</li><li>\"Ties dense\" became a point estimate.</li><li>The GRPO-block bullet now says C83 PARTIAL.</li><li>\"Does not stack\" (C202 PARTIAL) already matched. The long-context bullet is labelled \"no ledger claim yet\".</li><li><strong>notes/sketch.md:</strong> status rewritten from v0.5.14 to v0.5.20, with claim counts matching the ledger (140 claims). Seven decisions-log entries were added (v0.5.10-v0.5.20).</li><li><strong>experiments/launch/campaigns/README.md:</strong> the wave row now covers A1-A4, and the stale QUEUE timestamp is corrected.</li><li><strong>Checks:</strong> the main agent verified the diff, and every cited status matches the ledger. <code>post_training/SETUP.md</code> was already current.</li></ul>"
