   "date": "2026-11-23",
   "html": "<p><strong>A1 amendment 2 registered: a third seed for \"fixed depth beats random depth\"</strong> (quick review 13:14, statistician).</p><ul><li><strong>What runs:</strong> A1a (fixed r = 4) and A1i (random r, full backprop), which use equal training compute, at seed 2, paired with E27 seed 2. They run at the tail of the A3 wave.</li><li><strong>Prediction:</strong> A1a - A1i = -3% (range -5% to -1%). The comparison is confirmed only if the 3-seed paired CI lies below 0.</li><li><strong>Status until then:</strong> exploratory. The assembled recipe's fixed r is a design choice made on that basis.</li><li><strong>Status:</strong> the A3 all-parts arms are at 55-70% of training; first results are due in about 10 minutes.</li></ul>"
