   "html": "<p><strong>Docs refresh (hourly, Haiku; checked by the main agent).</strong></p><ul><li><strong>README:</strong> the pitch keeps its ambition but now says the 200M penalties compound (C202, PARTIAL), and that the project is in an assembly phase testing one compensation at a time (A1, E62). The status block says the same.</li><li><strong>README, new block:</strong> \"Where we are, in plain words\" under \"Start reading here\", accepted from quick review 11:03 (newcomer). In six sentences it explains F2, clean80/clean50, the 200M result and its LR caveat, E60/C203 (with the compute caveat), and that A1 is running. It has one link each to claims-status, side-quests and PREDICTIONS.</li><li><strong>notes/sketch.md:</strong> status at v0.5.1: assembly phase, claims 19/27/9/2/1/71/2 = 131, A1 fleet (7 of 8 rented boxes running; the 8th never left \"loading\" and was destroyed for $0.08).</li></ul>"
