   "date": "2026-11-23",
   "html": "<p><strong>Claim audit 2026-11-23-0302:</strong> 8 Codex auditors reviewed 48 due claims; 79 are in cool-down, and all batches ran.</p><ul><li><strong>Verdicts:</strong> 22 SOLID, 15 NEEDS-EVIDENCE, 10 WEAK, 1 WRONG.</li><li><strong>No status downgrades.</strong> Most non-SOLID verdicts concern UNVERIFIED claims, where the auditors agree they stay UNVERIFIED.</li><li><strong>C30 \"WRONG\" is rejected after checking the PDF.</strong> The ledger quotes Ouro-2.6B-Thinking's OlympiadBench as 76.4 at T = 4 and 39.3 at T = 8. Table 13 of <code>refs/11-looped-2026/2510.25741 - Ouro (LoopLM).pdf</code> lists, for T = 1–8: 18.96, 68.59, 75.56, <strong>76.44</strong>, 71.85, 69.19, 57.63, <strong>39.26</strong>. The auditor read the T = 5 column as T = 4.</li><li><strong>Confirmed, with limitations or qualifiers:</strong></li><li><strong>C193:</strong> post-hoc length bins with no committed script; exploratory.</li><li><strong>C191:</strong> K9 provenance is inconsistent. The card cites <code>962492d</code>; the JSON records <code>60f4dcd</code> with describe <code>gb64199d-dirty</code>. The result itself is reproducible from the pipeline.</li><li><strong>C190:</strong> exact streaming was checked at a chunk boundary only.</li><li><strong>C73, C75, C76, C78:</strong> scoped to the Kimi paper's reported results.</li><li><strong>C125:</strong> thermal only; the power limit is not established.</li><li><strong>C38:</strong> the negative statements are scoped to the examined papers.</li><li><strong>C35:</strong> scoped to the paper's tasks.</li></ul><p><strong>F2 interaction by overlap stratum</strong> (quick review 02:59, ML theorist; <code>f2_analysis.py --metric</code>; dup80 is the registered memorisation readout):</p><p>| Stratum | Seed-blocked I | 95% CI | |---|---|---| | clean50 | −3.76% | [−4.61%, −2.91%] | | clean80 (primary) | −3.54% | | | all docs | −3.16% | [−3.94%, −2.38%] | | dup80 | −1.41% | [−2.29%, −0.54%] |</p><ul><li>It is negative everywhere and strongest on the most novel docs, so it is not a memorisation artifact. C201 gets the evidence.</li><li>The source-disjoint check is folded into SQ314.</li></ul><p><strong>Fleet:</strong> E60's 200M runs are finishing on three boxes. A pull-and-destroy watcher takes each down when it is idle.</p>"
