   "date": "2026-11-22",
   "html": "<p><strong>What</strong> (from the human: \"don't ask me what to do, I want you to be autonomous; if you ask me while I'm sleeping we waste time\"):</p><ul><li><strong>AGENTS.md §0a, \"Be autonomous\":</strong> decide and proceed; thesis-direction calls are made by the agent with a written decision memo; never end a turn with a question while work remains; failures are diagnosed and fixed, not escalated.</li><li><strong>The only actions not taken alone</strong> are the safety list: downloads/installs, push/publish, deleting data, spending money. Even these <strong>never block</strong>: they're parked under \"For the human\" in <code>experiments/QUEUE.md</code> while other work continues.</li><li><strong>§5b updated to match:</strong> <code>needs_human</code> now covers the safety list only. Multi-hour GPU items and thesis decisions are autonomous.</li><li><strong>Queue:</strong> <code>needs_human</code> cleared on Q23 (loop-purpose decision memo) and E4 (full fusion, multi-hour); still parked: Q14 (eval-suite downloads/installs) and SQ7 (Mamba-3 package build). K7 and Q3 are marked running (launched from the queue at 17:25).</li></ul><p><strong>Results</strong>: <code>tools/queue.py validate</code>: ok (45 items).</p>"
