   "version": "v0.4.14",
   "title": "Experiment queue + autonomous-queue rule",
   "date": "2026-11-22",
   "html": "<p><strong>What</strong>:</p><ul><li><strong><code>experiments/queue.json</code></strong>: 45 prioritized items with dependencies, resources (GPU/CPU, minutes), <code>ready</code>/<code>missing</code>, <code>needs_human</code> and its reason, exact <code>launch</code> commands, and sources (queue subagent; reviewed by the main agent).</li><li><strong><code>tools/queue.py</code></strong> (stdlib): <code>list</code>, <code>next --gpu|--cpu [--max-minutes N]</code>, <code>show</code>, <code>set</code>, <code>add</code>, <code>move</code>, <code>validate</code>, <code>render</code>. It validates ids and cycles, never reorders silently, refuses a 2nd GPU or a 9th CPU item, and <code>next</code> skips <code>needs_human</code> items.</li><li><strong><code>experiments/QUEUE.md</code></strong>: the generated view.</li><li><strong>AGENTS.md §5b:</strong> the main agent works through the queue without asking the human, and asks only for <code>needs_human</code> items (download or install, &gt; 3 GPU-hours in one item, deleting data, pushing, thesis-direction change) or when a result contradicts an item's premise.</li><li>Q1 (predictions registered: v0.4.11, v0.4.13) and Q2 (<code>--lr</code> + campaign runner: v0.4.10) marked done.</li></ul><p><strong>Results</strong>: <code>validate</code>: ok (45 items, no unknown dependencies, no cycles). <code>next --gpu</code> → <strong>K7</strong> LR sweep (43 min); <code>next --cpu</code> → <strong>Q3</strong> K8 <code>--plan</code> (2 min).</p><p><strong>Ordering policy</strong>: validity first (controls, tuning, seeds), then cheap inference-only diagnostics on existing checkpoints, then thesis-critical runs (E11, neg-eig in the loop, E3 at the tuned LR, loop fixes), then side quests, then long-term items.</p><p><strong>Needs the human (queued, not auto-run)</strong>: Q14 eval suite tier 1 (downloads/installs), Q23 loop-purpose decision memo (thesis direction), E4 full fusion (&gt; 3 GPU-h), SQ7 Mamba-3 kernels (install/build).</p><p><strong>Next</strong>: run K7 (GPU) and Q3 (CPU) from the queue.</p>"
